p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Russell County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. That same pair hit 40% of normal in 2025. In 2026 so far, the middle of the grids ran 51% of normal for March to April, then 207% for May to June. Every one of the 8 grids had its driest year in 1954.</p>"}
